  'You are given a problem. Think about the problem and provide your reasoning. Place it between <reasoning> and </reasoning>. Then, provide the final answer (i.e., just one numerical value) between <answer> and </answer>.\n\nA rectangular prism has a volume of 750 cubic feet. Its length is 3 feet. What is its height?\n<reasoning>\nThe volume of a rectangular prism is given by the product of its length, width, and height. Since the volume is 750 cubic feet, we can write:\n\n750 = l \\times w \\times h\n<answer>\nh = 750 / (3 \\times w)\n</answer>\n</reasoning>\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang="en">\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>Problem 1</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <p>Problem 1: What is the sum of the first 20 positive integers?</p>\n    </header>\n    <section>\n        <p>Reasoning:</p>\n        <p>To find the sum of the first 20 positive integers, we can use the formula for the sum of an arithmetic series:\n        <answer>\n            The sum of the first 20 positive integers is 210.\n        </answer>\n    </section>\n    <footer class="page-footer">\n        <p>Problem 1</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang="en">\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>Problem 2</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <p>Problem 2: What is the perimeter of a square with a side length of 5 feet?</p>\n    </header>\n    <section>\n        <p>Reasoning:</p>\n        <p>The perimeter of a square is given by the formula:\n        <answer>\n            The perimeter of the square is 20 feet.\n        </answer>\n    </section>\n    <footer class="page-footer">\n        <p>Problem 2</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang="en">\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale