  'Given:\n- The price of the easel is $300\n- The price of one class is $50\n- The number of classes taken is 15\n- The cost of everything (easel, supplies, and classes) is $600\n\nProblem:\n- How much did everything cost?\n\nSolution:\n- Total cost = price of easel + price of supplies + price of classes\n- Total cost = $300 + 15 classes * $50\n- Total cost = $300 + $750\n- Total cost = $1050\n\nAnswer:\n- The total cost of everything is $1050.\n</reasoning>\n<answer>1050</answer>\n</problem>\n</problem>\n</user><eos>'
